      "writtenOn": "2018-10-03T17:15:32Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "we can change this to\n\nwhile (suspended_ports){\n   port \u003d __fls(suspended_ports);\n   suspended_ports \u0026\u003d ~ (1 \u003c\u003c port);\n   pd_set_suspend(port, 0);\n}\n\nand we rely on the pd_deferred_resume to not schedule bad ports",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 4123,
        "startChar": 1,
        "endLine": 4124,
        "endChar": 36
      },
      "revId": "2a1c2bddfcc3f2c5450bfe0b1a8d6a925389b360",
